<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>多項式大冒險</title>
<style>
  body{font-family:"Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;background:#f0f4f8;text-align:center;padding:20px;}
  h1{color:#2c3e50;}
  .screen{display:none;}
  .active{display:block;}
  button{padding:10px 18px;margin:6px;border:none;border-radius:8px;background:#3498db;color:#fff;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;}
  button:hover{background:#2980b9;}
  #score-board{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:10px;color:#34495e;}
  .expr{font-size:28px;margin:20px 0;color:#2c3e50;}
  #feedback,#feedback2,#feedback3{font-size:16px;margin-top:10px;min-height:24px;}
  .correct{color:green;}
  .wrong{color:red;}
  .card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,100px);gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin:20px auto;}
  .card{width:100px;height:70px;background:#3498db;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;}
  .card.flipped{background:#ecf0f1;color:#2c3e50;}
  .card.matched{background:#2ecc71;color:#fff;cursor:default;}
  .term-pool{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin:15px 0;}
  .term-btn{padding:10px 16px;background:#9b59b6;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;}
  .term-btn.used{background:#bdc3c7;cursor:default;}
  #order-result{font-size:20px;margin-top:10px;min-height:30px;color:#2c3e50;}
  #l3-options button{display:block;margin:8px auto;width:260px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>🎮 多項式大冒險</h1>
<div id="score-board">總分：<span id="total-score">0</span></div>

<div id="start-screen" class="screen active">
  <p>歡迎挑戰！共有4個關卡，考驗你對多項式的理解。</p>
  <button onclick="startLevel1()">開始遊戲</button>
</div>

<div id="level1" class="screen">
  <h2>關卡一：單項式偵探</h2>
  <p>請判斷以下代數式是否為「單項式」</p>
  <div class="expr" id="l1-expr"></div>
  <button onclick="answerL1(true)">是單項式</button>
  <button onclick="answerL1(false)">不是單項式</button>
  <div id="feedback"></div>
</div>

<div id="level2" class="screen">
  <h2>關卡二：同類項配對</h2>
  <p>點擊兩張卡片，找出「同類項」配對</p>
  <div class="card-grid" id="card-grid"></div>
  <div id="feedback2"></div>
</div>

<div id="level3" class="screen">
  <h2>關卡三：多項式屬性</h2>
  <div class="expr" id="l3-expr"></div>
  <p id="l3-question"></p>
  <div id="l3-options"></div>
  <div id="feedback3"></div>
</div>

<div id="level4" class="screen">
  <h2>關卡四：排列大師（降冪排列）</h2>
  <p>請依序點擊各項，組成降冪排列的多項式</p>
  <div class="term-pool" id="term-pool"></div>
  <div id="order-result"></div>
  <button onclick="checkOrder()">確認排列</button>
</div>

<div id="end-screen" class="screen">
  <h2>🎉 恭喜完成挑戰！</h2>
  <p>你的總分是：<span id="final-score"></span> / 100</p>
  <button onclick="restartGame()">再玩一次</button>
</div>

<script>
